And perhaps also this one:
Estimating population impacts via dynamic occupancy analysis of Before-After Control-Impact studies  <http://apps.webofknowledge.com/full_record.do?product=UA&search_mode=GeneralSearch&qid=10&SID=V2vfQnbnsIsC5b3gNWN&page=1&doc=1>
